|  identity   +-------------+    +------+------+-------------+
|             |             |    |             | right-split |
|             | right-split |    |             |     n-1     |
|             |             |    |  identity   +-------------+
|             |     n-1     |    |             | right-split |
|             |             |    |             |     n-1     |
+-------------+-------------+    +-------------+-------------+

       right-split n                    corner-split n
@end example

@end quotation
@end ifinfo
@iftex
@image{fig/chap2/Fig2.13a,132mm,,,.std.svg}
@caption{@strong{Figure 2.13:} Recursive plans for @code{right-split} and @code{corner-split}.}
@end iftex
